{
  "slug": "deployshield",
  "name": "Deployshield",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DeployShield is a cross-platform production safety guardrail for Claude Code and Gemini CLI. It intercepts terminal commands before execution and blocks dangerous operations (writes, deletes, etc.) while allowing read-only commands to pass through.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 command** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `deployshield` (Cloud infrastructure and production safety guardrails - prevents write/mutating operations on cloud, database, and deployment CLIs), `gemini` (Production safety guardrails - prevents write/mutating operations on cloud, database, and deployment CLIs)\n- **Commands** (1): `deployshield-status`\n- **Hooks** (2): `BeforeTool`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deployshield@claude-community` from `matanryngler/deployshield`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 1
  },
